@baseUrl = http://localhost:5081
@caseRef = replace-with-caseRef-from-cases
@inboxId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@logEntryId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@runId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@reviewedUrgency = replace-with-clinician-reviewed-pathway-code
@caseTaskId = replace-with-actual-careloop-task-id
@reportId = replace-with-report-id-from-cases

### Liveness
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Contract
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json

### Scenarios (cohort is listed but unsupported)
GET {{baseUrl}}/scenarios

### Headless replay: patient behaviour is not replayed here
POST {{baseUrl}}/scenarios/silent-patient/run
Content-Type: application/json

{"runKey":"team-demo"}

### Progress: replace runId with the returned run id
GET {{baseUrl}}/scenarios/runs/{{runId}}

### Source cases: copy a caseRef, diagnosticReportId and actual careLoopTaskId if known
GET {{baseUrl}}/cases

### Inbox; opening does not accept a handoff
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff-inbox?recipient=SYN-STAFF-DEMO

### Detail / unknown-id refusal
GET {{baseUrl}}/staff-inbox/{{inboxId}}

### Exact sent and received FHIR; caseRef, since (ISO 8601 instant, only newer entries) and limit (newest N) are optional
GET {{baseUrl}}/fhir-log?direction=sent&caseRef={{caseRef}}&limit=50

### One log entry by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/fhir-log/{{logEntryId}}

### Receive an actual case Task: copy real Task/report IDs, never invent CareLoop's id
POST {{baseUrl}}/fhir/Task
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType":"Task","id":"{{caseTaskId}}","status":"requested","intent":"order",
  "code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://careloop.invalid/fhir/CodeSystem/task-code","code":"case"}]},
  "basedOn":[{"reference":"DiagnosticReport/{{reportId}}"}],
  "owner":{"reference":"Practitioner/SYN-STAFF-DEMO"},
  "description":"SIMULATED a case needs your action"
}

### Staff notice PUT (the case is resolved through FHIR GET, best effort; the notice is filed either way)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/fhir/Task/staff-notice-demo
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{
  "resourceType":"Task","id":"staff-notice-demo","status":"requested","intent":"order",
  "code":{"coding":[{"system":"https://careloop.invalid/fhir/CodeSystem/task-code","code":"staff-notice"}]},
  "owner":{"identifier":{"value":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO"}},
  "focus":{"reference":"Task/{{caseTaskId}}"},
  "description":"SIMULATED a case needs your action"
}

### Explicit human-reviewed urgency: choose the source-reviewed code from the pathway
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/clinical-review
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO","role":"clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-A"},"urgency":"{{reviewedUrgency}}"}

### Propose ownership; previous owner remains accountable until acceptance. Without proposedOwner (and its facility) it only requests the consultation
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/consultation-request
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO","role":"clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-A"},"proposedOwner":{"syntheticId":"SYN-RECEIVING-DEMO","role":"receiving-clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-B"},"receivingFacility":"SYN-FAC-B"}

### Source human answers the consultation
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/consultation-answer
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-RECEIVING-DEMO","role":"receiving-clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-B"},"status":"accepted"}

### Source referral state (requested, accepted or rejected; never completed). An answer is sent alone, without a made-up request
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/referral
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO","role":"clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-A"},"status":"requested","receivingFacility":"SYN-FAC-B"}

### Receiving clinician decides: accepted is required (true or false); a body without it is refused with 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/referral-decision
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-RECEIVING-DEMO","role":"receiving-clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-B"},"accepted":false,"reason":"SIMULATED receiving facility declined"}

### Explicit source appointment facts; dates are examples, not clinical deadlines
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/appointment
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO","role":"clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-A"},"status":"booked","scheduledFor":"2026-11-20T09:00:00Z","location":"SYN Breast Imaging Clinic"}

### Finalized outcome: diagnosis is a configured placeholder evidence kind
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/outcome
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO","role":"clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-A"},"evidenceKind":"diagnosis","asFollowUpReport":false}

### Human closure request; CareLoop's gate may refuse and that refusal is shown explicitly
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/closure
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO","role":"clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-A"},"closureReason":"treated","evidenceResourceKey":"outcome"}

### Closure on surveillance: the date is yyyy-MM-dd; closureReason is one of treated, on-surveillance, negative-on-confirmation, declined, transferred-and-accepted, untraceable
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/closure
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO","role":"clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-A"},"closureReason":"on-surveillance","nextSurveillanceDate":"2027-03-04","evidenceResourceKey":"outcome"}

### Source consent grant; use inactive/rejected without contact for withdrawal
POST {{baseUrl}}/actions/consent
Content-Type: application/json

{"caseRef":"{{caseRef}}","performer":{"syntheticId":"SYN-STAFF-DEMO","role":"clinician","facility":"SYN-FAC-A"},"status":"active","caregiverContact":"SYN-CAREGIVER-DEMO"}

### Malformed FHIR is refused with 400 and logged
POST {{baseUrl}}/fhir/Task
Content-Type: application/fhir+json

{"resourceType":

### Unsupported cohort returns 422 without starting background work
POST {{baseUrl}}/scenarios/cohort/run
Content-Type: application/json

{}
